    // Comms: the hypernet (docs/hypernet.md). Capture: how far it hears what
    // happens; link: how far it reaches another comm (the shorter of the two
    // decides); lag (s) to pass a message on; capacity: messages an hour.
    // Reach goes as the root of power and both antennas' gain (Friis).
    (key: "comm.long.s1", brand: "brand.tallis", name: "LONG-RANGE COMM", does: Comm(capture: 3.0e8, link: 7.5e10, lag: 0.05, capacity: 3000.0), size: 1, mass: 300.0, volume: 0.8, power: 2.0e5, price: 9000.0),
    // Infrastructure (space structures only; nothing of it works from a world's ground).
